1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:06,916
Calvin B. Taylor's third quarter: the
most profitable of four Maryland
banks, with the slowest profit growth.

2
00:00:07,466 --> 00:00:11,852
Earnings rose about six percent to
one dollar sixty-two cents a share.

3
00:00:12,402 --> 00:00:16,663
Return on assets was one point five
nine percent, best of the four.

4
00:00:17,213 --> 00:00:21,857
Net interest income rose ten percent,
but expenses rose almost thirteen.

5
00:00:22,407 --> 00:00:28,352
And nonperforming loans climbed to
zero point eight three percent of
loans, from zero point one nine.

6
00:00:28,902 --> 00:00:32,092
A profitable bank, with costs and
credit to watch.

